<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Settings - DHMP Agbor</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="dashboard-body">

  <div class="dashboard-layout">
    
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-logo">
        <a href="/">
          <img src="/images/dashboardlogo.svg" alt="DHMP Agbor Logo">
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <ul class="sidebar-menu">
        <li><a href="/dashboard"><i class="fas fa-th-large"></i> Overview</a></li>
        <li><a href="/booking"><i class="fas fa-calendar-plus"></i> Book Appointment</a></li>
        <li><a href="/history"><i class="fas fa-history"></i> View History</a></li>
      </ul>

      <div class="sidebar-bottom">
        <ul class="sidebar-menu">
          <li><a href="/account"><i class="fas fa-user"></i> Account</a></li>
          <li class="active"><a href="/settings"><i class="fas fa-cog"></i> Settings</a></li>
          <li><a href="/login" class="logout"><i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i> Log Out</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="dashboard-content">
      
      <header class="dashboard-header">
        <div class="profile-shortcut">
          <div class="profile-pic">
            <img src="<%= user.profile_pic || '/images/profilepic.png' %>" alt="Profile">
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="page-title">
        <h1>Account Settings</h1>
        <p>Manage your security, notification preferences, and privacy.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="settings-container">
        
        <div class="booking-card settings-card">
          <div class="settings-header">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Security & Password</h3>
          </div>
          
          <form action="/api/change-password" method="POST" class="booking-form">
            <div class="input-group">
              <label for="current-password">Current Password</label>
              <input type="password" id="current-password" name="currentPassword" placeholder="Enter current password" required>
            </div>
            
            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="input-group">
                <label for="new-password">New Password</label>
                <input type="password" id="new-password" name="newPassword" placeholder="Enter new password" required>
              </div>
              <div class="input-group">
                <label for="confirm-password">Confirm New Password</label>
                <input type="password" id="confirm-password" name="confirmPassword" placeholder="Confirm new password" required>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="settings-action">
              <button type="submit" class="btn-book-submit btn-small">Update Password</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="booking-card settings-card">
          <div class="settings-header">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-bell"></i> Notification Preferences</h3>
          </div>
          
          <div class="toggle-row">
            <div class="toggle-text">
              <h4>Email Notifications</h4>
              <p>Receive appointment confirmations and medical results via email.</p>
            </div>
            <label class="switch">
              <input type="checkbox" checked>
              <span class="slider round"></span>
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="toggle-row">
            <div class="toggle-text">
              <h4>SMS Reminders</h4>
              <p>Get text messages 24 hours before your scheduled visit.</p>
            </div>
            <label class="switch">
              <input type="checkbox" checked>
              <span class="slider round"></span>
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="toggle-row borderless">
            <div class="toggle-text">
              <h4>Promotional Updates</h4>
              <p>Receive news about health campaigns in the Agbor community.</p>
            </div>
            <label class="switch">
              <input type="checkbox">
              <span class="slider round"></span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="booking-card settings-card danger-zone">
          <div class="settings-header">
            <h3 class="text-danger"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> Danger Zone</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Once you delete your account, there is no going back. All your medical appointment history will be permanently erased from the DHMP database.</p>
          <a href="/deactivate" class="btn-danger-outline" style="text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; text-align: center;">Deactivate Account</a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>